# Line endings are decided here rather than by whichever machine happens to commit.
#
# app.js and styles.css were once committed from Windows with CRLF while every other
# source file was LF, and every later edit to them came back as a whole-file diff that
# buried the real change and conflicted with anything edited elsewhere. Normalising in
# the repository keeps a diff about what actually changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.m4a binary
*.ogg binary
